@host = http://localhost:5080

### Small talk -> Local (smalltalk)
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "hello, how are you today?" } ]
}

### Light rewrite -> Local (rewrite-summarize)
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "Please summarize this email in two bullet points: the meeting moved to Friday." }
  ]
}

### Architecture question -> Cloud (deep-reasoning)
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Compare the trade-offs between event sourcing and a CRUD data model for our billing system." } ]
}

### Matches a local route (rewrite-summarize), but escalated to Cloud by complexity (structure + reasoning keywords)
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Summarize this article in three bullet points, then analyze the implications step by step and evaluate the trade-offs:\n1. Revenue grew 12%\n2. Churn doubled\n3. Two competitors merged\nWhat does this mean for us? What should we do next?" } ]
}

### No route matches -> FallbackTarget (Cloud)
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "what is the capital of France?" } ]
}

### Sensitive data -> pinned Local, never escalated
POST {{host}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "auto",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Look up the customer record for account number 4471" } ]
}

### Diagnostics: full decision with candidates and complexity signals
POST {{host}}/semantic-router/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "prompt": "why does this async code deadlock when I call .Result?" }
